                                                <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9472Theodore">Theodore “the Oriental”</persName>. According to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/RSEA4WPK"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1978BritishLibrary"/><title level="m">Catalogue of Ethiopian Manuscripts in the British Library Acquired Since the Year 1877</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>London</pubPlace><publisher>Published by British Museum Publications for the British Library</publisher><date>1978</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">British Museum</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1978BritishLibrary</note></note><note type="tag">British Museum</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1978BritishLibrary</note><citedRange unit="page">158</citedRange></bibl>, it is a tracing by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15033Playne">Beatrice Playne</persName>
